# Normalise to LF in the repo and in the working tree. The judge ships Python and
# Java harness sources that are written to disk verbatim and compiled on both
# Windows and Linux; mixed line endings there cause real bugs.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.db binary
